          "to": "Central and Eastern Galician [ˈθiŋkʊ], [ˈluθ]",
          "note": "In Middle Galician the affricates deaffricated, with different results in the west and the east. The central and eastern dialects have /θ/, while the western dialects have seseo: [ˈsiŋkʊ], [ˈlus]."
